    <briefdescription>
<para>Zero-Heap CRSF (TBS Crossfire / ExpressLRS) Protocol Parser. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>CRSF Specifications:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Baud rate: 420,000 / 921,600 / 1,875,000 bps, 8N1.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Frame Format: [Device Addr] [Payload Length] [Frame Type] [Payload...] [CRC8]</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Address: 0xC8 (Flight Controller), 0xEA (Radio Transmitter).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Types:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>0x16: RC Channels Frame (16 11-bit channels packed in 22 bytes, raw 170..1908 -&gt; 988..2012 us).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>0x14: Link Statistics (RSSI 1 &amp; 2, Link Quality, SNR).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>0x08: Battery Telemetry (Voltage, Current, Capacity, Remaining %).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>0x02: GPS Telemetry (Lat, Lon, Groundspeed, Heading, Altitude, Satellites).</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>CRC: CRC8 DVB-S2 (poly 0xD5) over Frame Type + Payload. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
